    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-0438-1748"
    affiliation: "Department of Information Engineering, Computer Science and Mathematics (DISIM), University of L'Aquila"
  - family-names: Rinaldi
    given-names: Claudia
abstract: >-
  PyTorch/Lightning pipeline for three-class guitar strumming-pattern recognition from pop/rock
  recordings: rhythm descriptors (onset strength, tempogram, tempogram ratio, beats, Rhythm
  Patterns and related statistics, Essentia ticks), one- and two-dimensional convolutional encoders
  with optional attention, a wavelet Kolmogorov-Arnold (Wav-KAN) classification head, and the
  scripted 468-configuration NAS/HPO campaign with its stored logs and results. It supports the
  IEEE IS2 2025 paper and includes a recording-disjoint re-evaluation of the selected models (2026).
  Research activities were mainly funded under the Ministerial Decree (DM) 118/2023, Mission 4,
  Component 1, Investment 4.1 of the National Recovery and Resilience Plan (PNRR) - "PNRR
  Research" - CUP: E11I23000100001. Research activities and publications were also partially
  supported by the European Union under the Italian National Recovery and Resilience Plan (PNRR)
  of NextGenerationEU, within the partnership on "Telecommunications of the Future" (PE00000001 -
  RESTART).
